---
// src/components/storefront/BrandStory.astro
---

<section class="w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#0b1516] py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-16 md:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="relative order-2 md:order-1 md:col-span-5">
        <div
          class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-20 -left-20 font-mono text-[15rem] font-bold text-[#dae5e6]/[0.02] select-none"
        >
          34%
        </div>
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <span
            class="mb-4 block font-mono text-6xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-white md:text-8xl"
            >34<span class="text-[#36f4a4]">%</span></span
          >
          <p
            class="max-w-[200px] font-mono text-sm tracking-widest text-[#dae5e6]/50 uppercase"
          >
            Average customer savings across all categories since launch.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="order-1 md:order-2 md:col-span-7">
        <h2
          class="mb-8 text-3xl leading-tight font-bold tracking-tight text-white md:text-5xl"
        >
          Built for people who refuse to overpay.
        </h2>
        <div
          class="max-w-xl space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed font-light text-[#dae5e6]/70"
        >
          <p>
            Symeno wasn't founded by retailers. It was founded by analysts who
            realized that global supply chain efficiencies were never reaching
            the end customer.
          </p>
          <p>
            We operate on a simple thesis: Volume is power. By aggregating
            demand and negotiating bulk positions with authorized brand
            partners, we can collapse the retail margin.
          </p>
          <p>
            We don't do flash sales. We don't do fake timers. We provide the
            structural best price, every single day.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10">
          <a
            href="/about"
            class="border-b border-[#36f4a4]/40 pb-1 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:border-[#36f4a4]"
          >
            Our Sourcing Ethics &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
